{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"records(at:)","externalID":"s:6Events12AcknowledgerP7records2atSayAA11EventRecordVGSays6UInt64VG_tF","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"at","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"required":true,"remoteSource":{"fileName":"DeliveryTag.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/DeliveryTag.swift#L77"}},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/records(at:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)-4jg2u"],"title":"Acknowledger Implementations","anchor":"Acknowledger-Implementations"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The records this store still keeps at ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"positions"},{"text":", read back for a destination whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivery buffer dropped them before it received them.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"at","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"positions","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The positions of records in this store a delivery handed to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destinations."}]}],"name":"positions"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The records kept at those positions, each tagged with its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeliveryTag"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"naming this store, in any order.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A delivery calls it once that destination has caught up, hands it the records returned,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and counts its receipt towards ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/acknowledge(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for those records alone. A position the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store no longer keeps (its bound dropped the record, which it reports) gives no record, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"neither does any position when the store can’t read records back, as with the default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"implementation. The delivery never acknowledges a record it couldn’t hand to every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination, so a store that still keeps one delivers it on a later launch, with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store of your own should implement it. Without it, the default returns no records, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch a full buffer dropped isn’t sent again in this run: the destination whose buffer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped it never gets it in this run, every destination gets it again on the next launch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"marked redelivered, and the store holds it until then, toward its bound."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The delivery gives each record returned the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sensitive-value visibility and the "},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the record had when the buffer dropped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it, so a store needn’t keep them. A record tagged with another store is ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord/isRedelivered":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isRedelivered"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"title":"isRedelivered","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the record may have reached a destination before: it was handed to a delivery in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"earlier run of the app, which ended before the delivery was acknowledged."}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/isredelivered","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What keeps records until their delivery is acknowledged: a store, as a delivery sees it."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Acknowledger"}],"title":"Acknowledger","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Acknowledger"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/events","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","abstract":[{"text":"The types every other module shares: the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Events","role":"collection"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/DeliveryTag":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/deliverytag","abstract":[{"text":"Where a store keeps a record until it is delivered: the store, and the record’s position in it.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeliveryTag","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeliveryTag","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DeliveryTag","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DeliveryTag","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventRecord"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","kind":"symbol","role":"s